WEBVTT

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:23.540
Now, you there... Tell 
him this: "It was fun."

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:13.980
<b>The Doctor Has Arrived</b>

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:30.480
Listen up! Until you bring them back, 
I'm not letting you into the house!

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:40.970
I'm home.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:42.040
You're late!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:47.460
Where in blazes have you been 
tramping about all this time?

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:51.350
While <i>I</i> traversed the four corners 
of the world in service to my master!

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.770
Were you having fun playing "beat 'em up"?

00:02:54.220 --> 00:02:55.370
Hey!

00:02:55.370 --> 00:02:59.780
To think you would slink home after leaving 
the master stuck on that man's back...

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:01.780
You're pathetic!

00:03:01.780 --> 00:03:04.630
W-Wait, how do you...

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:08.290
Anyway, I'm not his parent anymore, right?

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:09.540
Fool!

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:14.820
Answer me: Who other than you would 
be the master's parent at the moment?

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:15.460
What?

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:25.280
As I could not determine 
the master's illness,

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:28.250
I decided I had to bring 
back a specialist with me.

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:31.140
Watch your manners.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.440
This is a well-known doctor 
in the Demon World.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.740
Doctor?

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.030
This guy?

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:41.010
He looks easy for a level-1 
character to beat.

00:03:41.010 --> 00:03:42.530
What are you doing?

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:44.810
Hurry and get in here!

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:51.420
Sheesh... I can't believe that Beelze-sama 
is being raised in this cramped little house.

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:52.900
I'm flabbergasted.

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:54.540
Who?

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:58.770
Wait, wait, wait...

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:02.260
Don't tell me... this 
little brat is the doctor?

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:05.170
Dang, you're tiny... What 
are you, a 4th grader?

00:04:05.170 --> 00:04:06.950
And wait, she's a Demon too?

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.950
She's not just some lost little girl?

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:10.250
Insolence!

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:17.280
Ah, I see.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:21.640
You're Oga? Just as useless 
a man as I've heard...

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:25.450
That hurt worse than Tojo's...

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:28.950
Why, you...! What the hell was that for?

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:31.040
And you stink of poverty!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.180
I feel sorry for Miss Hilda 
having to live with you.

00:04:34.180 --> 00:04:36.170
And you smell like a swamp!

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:40.050
About that last part, Lamia, he smells 
like that because he fell in the river.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.280
That's the only part you correct?!

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:44.060
You little brat!

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:45.510
Get over here!

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:49.640
And really, the Great Demon 
Lord never changes either!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:51.510
Why, you...

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:57.520
No human is fit to be 
parent of a Demon Lord...

00:04:58.030 --> 00:04:59.270
Too slow, too slow!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:02.110
Speaking from my position as a doctor...

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:05.400
I'm starting to see what's wrong here!

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.410
Be quiet for a bit.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:15.030
Let me introduce everyone again.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:20.240
This is the Court Physician Doctor Furcas 
Rachmaninoff and his assistant, Lamia.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:20.900
Hi.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:24.850
So that thing <i>was</i> the doctor!

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:27.810
Sheesh, be more obvious about it!

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:29.430
Say something first!

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:32.540
And anyway, what's with this character?

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.430
This design has got to go.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:35.920
It's totally winged!

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:37.820
I am not winged!

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:41.090
And it can read my mind!

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:42.130
I am not reading it!

00:05:43.070 --> 00:05:46.240
Okay? Let me say this first.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:49.230
I am actually extremely cool.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:51.800
Doctor has an extreme hatred of humans, see.

00:05:51.800 --> 00:05:54.610
So he uses a Mu-mu body instead.

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:56.580
Oh, this is a Mu-mu.

00:05:56.580 --> 00:06:01.840
Now then, I've come rushing here, 
but I don't see the patient?

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:06.840
How should I know? He was gone 
when I woke up this morning.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:11.350
Well, after listening to Hilda-dono, I 
believe I have a grasp of the situation.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:14.340
Beelze-sama's illness is Royal Fever.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:18.700
It is common for royalty with large 
amounts of latent power to succumb to it.

00:06:18.700 --> 00:06:20.730
Sort of like a teething fever.

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:22.230
Teething fever?

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:26.470
Yes. It is a fever which 
occurs when a baby grows.

00:06:27.390 --> 00:06:31.740
I'm sure you've experienced it with 
Beelze-sama a number of times by now, yes?

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:35.740
Perhaps that is why Hilda-dono 
was caught off guard...

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.960
But this time the situation 
is a little different.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:42.650
Why? Because this is the Human World.

00:06:42.650 --> 00:06:47.800
Human assistance is required for 
Beelze-sama to unleash his magical power.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:53.810
Therefore, Beelze-sama's growing magical 
power has become too great for you to handle.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:58.450
In order to prevent a such a great 
magic force from flowing out into you,

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:02.320
Beelze-sama subconsciously 
cut the link between you.

00:07:02.780 --> 00:07:06.530
For if he did not, he would 
have surely killed you.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:13.110
In other words, this is all your fault for not 
growing fast enough to keep up with Beelze-sama!

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:14.770
Get the picture, half-wit?!

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.790
Stay silent for a little longer.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:24.280
So Baby Beel went looking for 
a new parent and found Tojo...

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.300
No, that's not the case.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.670
If that man has what it takes 
to be the master's parent,

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:32.950
the master would have already 
released his magical power,

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:35.050
and his fever should have gone down.

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:39.450
And besides... I could not 
sense any malice from that man.

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:42.300
I have no complaints about 
his strength, however.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.500
You were watching?

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:47.400
It's probably a temperament issue.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.580
Wait... Then...

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:52.570
What was that?

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:56.330
But it is true...

00:07:57.160 --> 00:08:00.580
Why is the master sticking to that man?

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:11.450
Man, it's damn hot today too.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:30.070
Here kitty kitty, no need to be afwaid...

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:33.180
Yes-yes, come here...

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.230
What are you doing, Tojo-san?

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:41.110
Hurry and carry these boxes! 
It's <i>your</i> job, remember?

00:08:41.480 --> 00:08:46.640
Man... You call me all of a sudden, and it's 
to help you clean up after the festival?

00:08:46.640 --> 00:08:48.340
I'm not your little helper boy, you know.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.600
Shoji...

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:53.140
You're gonna get it!

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:53.840
Wait!

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:59.850
Man... It's really gotten late.

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.660
I can sense an animal.

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.860
A dog? A cat?

00:09:07.860 --> 00:09:09.580
This guy...

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:11.860
There!

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.240
It's a baby...

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:23.590
Hey, this ain't good, man...

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:26.310
Don't tell me that it's been abandoned...

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.130
Come 'ere, come 'ere! That's a good boy...

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.630
Wait, you're treating him like an animal?

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:38.470
You're not a dog or a cat!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:41.470
Yes, that's right... Come up 'ere...

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:54.850
How cute!

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.320
H-He likes him!

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:57.690
Shoji...

00:09:58.320 --> 00:09:59.840
I'm keeping him!

00:10:02.110 --> 00:10:04.640
No-no-no... You don't "keep" some baby!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:05.600
I'm totally keeping him!

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:07.740
This isn't right, Tojo-san!

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:17.150
Anyway, the most important thing is 
to improve your growth as his parent.

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:23.550
This time only, I am 100% 
on your side, you bastard.

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:27.560
If you're a man, then suck it up 
and win! Take the master back!

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:30.430
Those who seek to be the Demon Lord's parent

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:32.790
will not be forgiven for crying 
themselves to sleep after losing!

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:37.960
What the hell are you deciding for me?

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.670
I ain't lost yet.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:43.130
The fight's still on, idiot.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.080
That'll do.

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:50.720
It seems like we've come to an understanding.

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:51.990
Yes.

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:00.480
Then, shall we start?

00:11:15.640 --> 00:11:18.540
It seems like we've come to an understanding.

00:11:19.140 --> 00:11:19.960
Yes.

00:11:25.130 --> 00:11:27.910
Then, shall we start?

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:32.170
Yes. Now shoot him.

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:35.910
Wait, wait... What's starting?

00:11:35.910 --> 00:11:38.160
And what the hell is that you're holding?

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:38.820
Hey!

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.630
Cut the  noise! Quiet!

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.010
Why, you...

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:45.000
Don't worry. Just a little shock therapy.

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:49.140
This is to repair the link 
between you and the master.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.950
Give me a break! When did I say I was 
gonna get linked with Baby Beel again?

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:55.770
I don't give a crap about that!

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.280
I just want to beat that jerk, Tojo!

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:00.480
I said to be quiet.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:08.980
I shot him with the spirit drug 
made from Uroboros's bones...

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:13.510
This is the best thing for the 
growth of the Demon Lord's parent.

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:20.460
With this drug, he's been thrown into a 
world that's a fixed loop within his mind.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:26.100
The only way to escape is to 
restore the link with Beelze-sama.

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:31.240
Yes. But one false step, 
and he can never return.

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:33.440
It is a dangerous gamble.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.520
Never return? And that means...?

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.440
Right! He'll die!

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.590
W-Where is this place?

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:06.220
The inside of your mind...

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:09.170
Furuichi... And you're stacked!

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:12.220
I am not Furuichi, I am Montesquieu!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.870
Three Branches of Government!

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:24.360
Wait, wait... What the heck 
kind of attack name is that?

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:26.990
You just hit me 'cause you 
thought you could, right?

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.490
I did not hit you!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:31.360
You did too! Don't deny it!

00:13:31.800 --> 00:13:33.580
Listen well, dear friend.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:38.300
You are currently in an 
extremely dangerous situation.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:42.160
To put it in terms of farts, you've 
let out sort of a juicy, silent one.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:43.450
Why in terms of farts?

00:13:43.450 --> 00:13:45.220
And that's not dangerous at all.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:51.260
The Uroboros that girl shot you with 
is a snake that eats its own tail.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:52.370
Do you understand?

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:56.550
The world you are in now is the same way.

00:13:56.550 --> 00:13:59.850
To escape from here, you 
must search for the key.

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:01.020
Key?

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:05.300
Yes. Search for the thing you need most.

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:08.620
What's that supposed to mean? Explain 
it in a way I can understand!

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.640
In other words...

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:10.880
Oops, time's up.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.380
In other words what?!

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:13.730
Hey!

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:18.630
What the hell...

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:19.710
What the hell...

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:23.150
Um... So basically, um...

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:28.300
I was shot by that Lamia girl, and 
now I'm in some kind of deep sleep?

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:32.230
Then all this is inside of my head?

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:34.290
What the hell am I thinking?

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:40.300
Hello, lovely lady!

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.590
Going for a walk?

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:44.900
Himekawa and Kanzaki!

00:14:44.900 --> 00:14:49.550
Yes, it will be a brilliant gold...

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:52.660
...afternoon, and we can't wait!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.540
It can't be... You guys are my...

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:58.610
No, that can't be.

00:14:58.610 --> 00:15:00.370
Nope. Not a chance.

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:03.200
C-Calm down...

00:15:07.450 --> 00:15:09.230
That's...

00:15:19.640 --> 00:15:21.900
One such as you cannot overtake me!

00:15:22.700 --> 00:15:24.650
A-Are you an idiot?

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:38.340
Can you even follow me to 
Lord Haptom Oggah's heart?

00:15:38.340 --> 00:15:40.380
A-Are you an idiot?!

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.470
Are you an idiot?!

00:16:06.980 --> 00:16:09.360
W-Wait a second...

00:16:10.170 --> 00:16:13.990
Furuichi showed up, then 
Kanzaki and Himekawa...

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:17.860
Then there was Hilda and 
Kunieda and Alaindelon...

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:20.890
Which means, if it follows the pattern...

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:27.030
I knew it... Me!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.940
{I'm not going to sub this, as I think it's marginally funnier this way}

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:38.900
Yup. Called it.

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:44.570
This is totally the pattern where I end 
up having to defeat myself in the end.

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:45.380
No!

00:16:46.470 --> 00:16:48.070
I don't like violence.

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:51.480
Nothing comes from violence.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:53.850
People have the power to talk things out.

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:59.700
Using words instead of fists to bridge one's 
differences is the first step to world peace!

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:02.200
Um, then what should I do?

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.720
Isn't it obvious?

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:06.360
We shall have a long conversation together.

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:09.000
Both laying our feelings bare to each other,

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.640
we shall have a lively exchange of ideas.

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:15.000
We take our time finding each 
other's negotiating points,

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:16.860
and one by one our doubts...

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:19.040
Sounds like a pain.

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.330
Since my left cheek was punched,

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:24.310
please do the right one now!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.490
Since my right cheek was punched,

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:37.490
please do the left one now!

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:39.490
Shut up!

00:17:47.140 --> 00:17:49.670
Since my left cheek was punched...

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:51.170
God damn it!

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:53.780
Please do the right one now!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:59.430
Why, you...

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:09.840
Since my right cheek was punched,

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:13.830
please do the left one now!

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:31.090
Move it!

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:32.940
Move it!

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:38.590
Damn it... I... Why, you...

00:18:50.350 --> 00:18:51.280
Baby Beel?

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:09.230
Baby Beel...

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:28.140
It looks like he's found him.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:31.270
Yes, but the issue begins now.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:34.770
Right. The rejection has begun.

00:19:48.900 --> 00:19:50.040
Hey, Kaoru.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:53.410
Studying for entrance exams again today?

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:56.940
Seems tough. What is this? I have no clue.

00:19:57.220 --> 00:19:58.170
Tora.

00:19:59.150 --> 00:19:59.930
What is it?

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:03.440
Come with me.

00:20:08.080 --> 00:20:09.930
I fought with Oga.

00:20:11.530 --> 00:20:15.030
It's rare that someone injures you.

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:19.150
Yeah. He's got backbone, 
just like we thought.

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:24.350
I may have bashed him 
good, but he'll be back.

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:29.410
Actually, Tora, I have something 
I need to mention to you.

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:33.560
It's about that baby that's sticking to you.

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:39.620
Do you know the other name 
for the Rampaging Ogre?

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:41.710
The BoB Brawler.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:46.270
But lately it seems like his 
Baby ain't on Board any more.

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:49.130
So, Tora... Is that Oga's...

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:53.820
That sounds like an interesting story.

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:59.480
Let us join in the fun, Tojo.

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:19.190
It has been 6 hours since 
we injected the drug.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:22.020
If, after waiting this 
long, he doesn't wake up...

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:25.650
It failed? It didn't work?

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:27.480
Yay!

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.180
G-Good morning!

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.670
I caught you, you little brat!

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:41.800
I'll teach you some manners, I will!

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:44.580
Let me go! Let me go, you perv!

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:47.110
Go ahead and yell!

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:49.440
It looks like you passed through the crisis.

00:21:50.560 --> 00:21:53.450
All that's left is to take the master back.

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:55.150
How do you feel?

00:21:55.470 --> 00:21:57.480
Let me go!

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:01.680
I feel awful. Whaddaya expect?

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:36.020
Hilda-chan, welcome back!

00:23:36.950 --> 00:23:40.020
Your cousin? She's so cute!

00:23:40.020 --> 00:23:42.050
What's this? A pet?

00:23:42.050 --> 00:23:44.020
It's a Macao pet!

00:23:44.020 --> 00:23:46.430
Is this okay? I mean, seriously now...

00:23:46.430 --> 00:23:47.790
What's with this house?

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:03.250
Three Branches of Government!

00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:05.440
You're still doing that, Furuichi?

00:24:05.440 --> 00:24:08.420
I am not Furuichi, I am Montesquieu.

00:24:08.420 --> 00:24:10.730
It seems like you have escaped the danger.

00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:14.590
Yeah. But I haven't settled things with Tojo.

00:24:15.390 --> 00:24:18.140
I-It's not like I'm doing it 
to get Baby Beel back, okay?

00:24:18.770 --> 00:24:22.730
On the next Beelzebub: Everyone Assemble!

00:24:22.730 --> 00:24:24.000
Although it's not at 8 AM!

00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:24.980
Brush your teeth!

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:26.400
You finished your homework?

00:24:26.400 --> 00:24:27.990
See you next week!
